(1827787, 250936, 39880, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting.  The part covering her right eye kind of bothers me.  But no biggie, I think it is a good shot.  9</td>', 'I like the lighting.  The part covering her right eye kind of bothers me.  But no biggie, I think it is a good shot.  9', '2005-10-31 17:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
