(1828188, 251388, 37875, '<td valign="top">wow! a gas mask and avant-guarde picture in a dpc challenge!  i love it!!<br/>i really dig the mottled effect from your transparent medium for this photo.  i also like the color treatment and message the model''s relaying...especially since the far left side is clear and the toxins (or whatever you want to call them...i think of them as toxins) are only around the model.<br/> <br/>with the aesthetic tastes of this web site, i''m betting that you may not score as high as i think you should (just like mine isn''t going to score as high as i''d like in this one because it flies in the face of the traditional dpc aesthetic)...but this picture really nails the theme for me--where the transparancy adds to the primary focus and theme of your picture.  very nicely done!!!!!!!  good luck!</td>', 'wow! a gas mask and avant-guarde picture in a dpc challenge!  i love it!!i really dig the mottled effect from your transparent medium for this photo.  i also like the color treatment and message the model''s relaying...especially since the far left side is clear and the toxins (or whatever you want to call them...i think of them as toxins) are only around the model. with the aesthetic tastes of this web site, i''m betting that you may not score as high as i think you should (just like mine isn''t going to score as high as i''d like in this one because it flies in the face of the traditional dpc aesthetic)...but this picture really nails the theme for me--where the transparancy adds to the primary focus and theme of your picture.  very nicely done!!!!!!!  good luck!', '2005-10-31 19:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
