(1829916, 251021, 24212, '<td valign="top">A really interesting abstract, made by the colours. Well spotted.</td>', 'A really interesting abstract, made by the colours. Well spotted.', '2005-11-01 13:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829923, 251327, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, this looks a liittle cluttered. For some reason, there seems to be a little too much pavement at the bottom of the frame for my liking. Good, strong colours, without seeming oversaturated.</td>', 'To me, this looks a liittle cluttered. For some reason, there seems to be a little too much pavement at the bottom of the frame for my liking. Good, strong colours, without seeming oversaturated.', '2005-11-01 13:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829925, 250150, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the way that you''ve captured just enough detail in the face. Too much detail and the whole thing might look a little too flat and ordinary. The strong silhouettes of the hands contrast nicely with the rest of the shot.</td>', 'I really like the way that you''ve captured just enough detail in the face. Too much detail and the whole thing might look a little too flat and ordinary. The strong silhouettes of the hands contrast nicely with the rest of the shot.', '2005-11-01 13:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829932, 250123, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the bee, although I find that the image divides up into ''bands''. The top band is blurred. The next band is the bee and its immediate surroundings. The next one is the petals below the bee and the final one is the in-focus stem at the bottom of the picture. It is this last one that creates, for me, a strange effect that reduces the potential impact of the shot. The upshot of this is that I would suggest a crop at the bottom of the frame. Great macro all the same.</td>', 'Great shot of the bee, although I find that the image divides up into ''bands''. The top band is blurred. The next band is the bee and its immediate surroundings. The next one is the petals below the bee and the final one is the in-focus stem at the bottom of the picture. It is this last one that creates, for me, a strange effect that reduces the potential impact of the shot. The upshot of this is that I would suggest a crop at the bottom of the frame. Great macro all the same.', '2005-11-01 13:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829934, 251442, 24212, '<td valign="top">Really stark and striking, although it is apity about the branches that appear to intrude across the web.</td>', 'Really stark and striking, although it is apity about the branches that appear to intrude across the web.', '2005-11-01 13:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829940, 250729, 24212, '<td valign="top">I find this to be an image that I can just sit and look at. Not a very technical critique, I know, but it is a great picture to just sit and contemplate. The contrast in sharpness between the stained glass (?) and its shadows is great.</td>', 'I find this to be an image that I can just sit and look at. Not a very technical critique, I know, but it is a great picture to just sit and contemplate. The contrast in sharpness between the stained glass (?) and its shadows is great.', '2005-11-01 13:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829944, 249663, 24212, '<td valign="top">The outline of the frog (toad?) is brilliantly realised and the positioning of it in amongst the radial lines is great. The only small gripe is the dark triangle to the left of the frog. Perhaps that could have been cloned out.</td>', 'The outline of the frog (toad?) is brilliantly realised and the positioning of it in amongst the radial lines is great. The only small gripe is the dark triangle to the left of the frog. Perhaps that could have been cloned out.', '2005-11-01 13:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829967, 251414, 24212, '<td valign="top">A great expression captured, although I feel that there is too much clutter inside the window.</td>', 'A great expression captured, although I feel that there is too much clutter inside the window.', '2005-11-01 13:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829970, 250977, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great colour in the water. I only wish that the duckling were facing toward the camera, rather than away from it.</td>', 'Great colour in the water. I only wish that the duckling were facing toward the camera, rather than away from it.', '2005-11-01 13:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829972, 250577, 24212, '<td valign="top">Just perhaps a little too busy for me. Strong lines, yet nothing to really draw my eye in.</td>', 'Just perhaps a little too busy for me. Strong lines, yet nothing to really draw my eye in.', '2005-11-01 13:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829974, 251353, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great texture. The lower left corner spoils the pattern a bit, though.</td>', 'Great texture. The lower left corner spoils the pattern a bit, though.', '2005-11-01 13:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829982, 251557, 24212, '<td valign="top">I''ve sat here for a few minutes now and cannot really work out what this is. Is it a boat? I do, however, like the starburst highlights.</td>', 'I''ve sat here for a few minutes now and cannot really work out what this is. Is it a boat? I do, however, like the starburst highlights.', '2005-11-01 13:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829987, 251126, 24212, '<td valign="top">''If in doubt, get the eyes sharp''. You did that exceptionally here. The muted colours are great and the detail is superb. I bet that this was difficult to capture with such shallow DOF.</td>', '''If in doubt, get the eyes sharp''. You did that exceptionally here. The muted colours are great and the detail is superb. I bet that this was difficult to capture with such shallow DOF.', '2005-11-01 14:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829992, 250662, 24212, '<td valign="top">A nice detail shot, although I get more of a feeling of ''reflection'' rather than ''transparency''.</td>', 'A nice detail shot, although I get more of a feeling of ''reflection'' rather than ''transparency''.', '2005-11-01 14:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829998, 250671, 42100, '<td valign="top">Good social commentary!  I like the use of photographic technique to make your statement.  Good, interesting photo aside from that.</td>', 'Good social commentary!  I like the use of photographic technique to make your statement.  Good, interesting photo aside from that.', '2005-11-01 14:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
