(1830055, 251388, 40718, '<td valign="top">Wait, gas mask...nico?  I think the creativity is there in spades for this shot, but ultimately I don''t really like the water drops.  They are not attractive in their highlighted form.  6</td>', 'Wait, gas mask...nico?  I think the creativity is there in spades for this shot, but ultimately I don''t really like the water drops.  They are not attractive in their highlighted form.  6', '2005-11-01 14:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
