(1830062, 250949, 40718, '<td valign="top">Neither terrible nor superior.  The best thing is probably the sillouetted head which frames the hand and adds to the sinister mystery.</td>', 'Neither terrible nor superior.  The best thing is probably the sillouetted head which frames the hand and adds to the sinister mystery.', '2005-11-01 14:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
