(1830067, 251423, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice "double exposure".  I would have preferred a little less highlight on her chest, but maybe that is required to give her more "substance" (ie block the background). 7</td>', 'Nice "double exposure".  I would have preferred a little less highlight on her chest, but maybe that is required to give her more "substance" (ie block the background). 7', '2005-11-01 14:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830071, 251463, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great symmetry and colours. It''s almost a pity that the people are there.</td>', 'Great symmetry and colours. It''s almost a pity that the people are there.', '2005-11-01 14:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830077, 251051, 40718, '<td valign="top">Water shots take a lot of attention to detail to make "perfect".  There are bubbles and water marks above and below the water line.  If you really want to hit these shots, you need to avoid those (it can be hard).  I think the ultimately let''s this picture down.</td>', 'Water shots take a lot of attention to detail to make "perfect".  There are bubbles and water marks above and below the water line.  If you really want to hit these shots, you need to avoid those (it can be hard).  I think the ultimately let''s this picture down.', '2005-11-01 14:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830078, 250940, 24212, '<td valign="top">I laughed when I saw this, but probably shouldn''t have. I think that the lighting is great and the idea is superb.</td>', 'I laughed when I saw this, but probably shouldn''t have. I think that the lighting is great and the idea is superb.', '2005-11-01 14:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830081, 249993, 40718, '<td valign="top">Somewhat interesting still life.  I like the composition best.</td>', 'Somewhat interesting still life.  I like the composition best.', '2005-11-01 14:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830082, 251456, 24212, '<td valign="top">A pair of scissors? Good idea, although the scratches on the handle itself spoil it a tiny bit.</td>', 'A pair of scissors? Good idea, although the scratches on the handle itself spoil it a tiny bit.', '2005-11-01 14:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830086, 250932, 40718, '<td valign="top">A polarizer whould have helped this shot.</td>', 'A polarizer whould have helped this shot.', '2005-11-01 14:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830091, 251020, 24212, '<td valign="top">The effect of the water is absolutely stunning. The first thing I did when I saw this picture was to gasp. The swan is placed perfectly within the frame.</td>', 'The effect of the water is absolutely stunning. The first thing I did when I saw this picture was to gasp. The swan is placed perfectly within the frame.', '2005-11-01 14:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830093, 251075, 40718, '<td valign="top">Moody and mysterious.  After image grain, I am starting to like some "texture" to pictures.  (This isn''t noise, but the texture of the gauze). 7</td>', 'Moody and mysterious.  After image grain, I am starting to like some "texture" to pictures.  (This isn''t noise, but the texture of the gauze). 7', '2005-11-01 14:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830094, 249985, 24212, '<td valign="top">An interesting abstract, although perhaps a little too centred.</td>', 'An interesting abstract, although perhaps a little too centred.', '2005-11-01 14:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830097, 249621, 40718, '<td valign="top">A little too confusing in the center there.  Maybe remove some of the leaves.  The angled composition is probably a little extreme.</td>', 'A little too confusing in the center there.  Maybe remove some of the leaves.  The angled composition is probably a little extreme.', '2005-11-01 14:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830098, 251268, 28029, '<td valign="top">Sorry- I have looked at this twice and still don''t get it. I will try again later.</td>', 'Sorry- I have looked at this twice and still don''t get it. I will try again later.', '2005-11-01 14:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830101, 251460, 40718, '<td valign="top">He''s cute, but the composition makes him look like an "egghead".  I''m sure he isn''t in real life.</td>', 'He''s cute, but the composition makes him look like an "egghead".  I''m sure he isn''t in real life.', '2005-11-01 14:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830102, 251147, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the splash of colour in the image, although I think that the light white portion down the right-hand side is a little too intrusive.</td>', 'I like the splash of colour in the image, although I think that the light white portion down the right-hand side is a little too intrusive.', '2005-11-01 14:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830104, 251344, 24212, '<td valign="top">This image looks a little noisy and over-processed to me. Is that a function of compression ?</td>', 'This image looks a little noisy and over-processed to me. Is that a function of compression ?', '2005-11-01 14:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830105, 251442, 40718, '<td valign="top">The excess web probably hurts this picture more than it helpls.  Although then you might be left with too simple a shot.  Spider webs are hard to capture well in a picture which is overall interesting.</td>', 'The excess web probably hurts this picture more than it helpls.  Although then you might be left with too simple a shot.  Spider webs are hard to capture well in a picture which is overall interesting.', '2005-11-01 14:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830109, 251200, 24212, '<td valign="top">I had an idea rather like this, but I''m glad I didn''t enter it, as yours turned out better than I envisaged mine as being.</td>', 'I had an idea rather like this, but I''m glad I didn''t enter it, as yours turned out better than I envisaged mine as being.', '2005-11-01 14:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830110, 250999, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure of the technique, but I''m not too sure I''m enamored by it.  I''ll keep a neutral score on this one. 6</td>', 'I''m not sure of the technique, but I''m not too sure I''m enamored by it.  I''ll keep a neutral score on this one. 6', '2005-11-01 14:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830113, 249128, 24212, '<td valign="top">The delicacy of this shot is stunning. The only downside to it is the slightly soft section to the left of the leaf. I feel that this would be even stronger were the whole of the leaf in sharp focus.</td>', 'The delicacy of this shot is stunning. The only downside to it is the slightly soft section to the left of the leaf. I feel that this would be even stronger were the whole of the leaf in sharp focus.', '2005-11-01 14:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830114, 250150, 40718, '<td valign="top">DPC line...OOF.  I''m sure you are getting hammered.  I think the darkness is probably a bigger problem than the DOF.  I like the idea, but I think the blacks were taken a little too far.</td>', 'DPC line...OOF.  I''m sure you are getting hammered.  I think the darkness is probably a bigger problem than the DOF.  I like the idea, but I think the blacks were taken a little too far.', '2005-11-01 14:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830115, 249985, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think it''s cool. 8</td>', 'I think it''s cool. 8', '2005-11-01 14:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830119, 250267, 40718, '<td valign="top">A little too dark.  I know the label is the subject rather than the liquid, but it would have been nice to givev it some color and make it look more alive than it does now.</td>', 'A little too dark.  I know the label is the subject rather than the liquid, but it would have been nice to givev it some color and make it look more alive than it does now.', '2005-11-01 14:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830120, 251200, 40718, '<td valign="top">Creative...scary, but creative.  I''m not sure why I want to look at a man wrapped in saran though...</td>', 'Creative...scary, but creative.  I''m not sure why I want to look at a man wrapped in saran though...', '2005-11-01 14:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830125, 250650, 40718, '<td valign="top">hmmm, the larger reflection is distracting.  I think I would have liked the shot without it as a neat architectural abstract. 6</td>', 'hmmm, the larger reflection is distracting.  I think I would have liked the shot without it as a neat architectural abstract. 6', '2005-11-01 14:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830129, 251562, 40718, '<td valign="top">the colors are well done here. the subject isn''t awe inspiring.  I''ll give you the "potential in an ad campaign" vote. 7</td>', 'the colors are well done here. the subject isn''t awe inspiring.  I''ll give you the "potential in an ad campaign" vote. 7', '2005-11-01 14:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830132, 251383, 40718, '<td valign="top">creative.  I''ll give you that...6</td>', 'creative.  I''ll give you that...6', '2005-11-01 14:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830135, 250539, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why I want pumpkins transposed over a skull.  The two have little to do with each other (except simply being two halloween icons).  Technicals aren''t bad.</td>', 'I''m not sure why I want pumpkins transposed over a skull.  The two have little to do with each other (except simply being two halloween icons).  Technicals aren''t bad.', '2005-11-01 14:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830140, 249650, 40718, '<td valign="top">A nice simple landscape.  Maybe less of the big black section would have been nice, but I don''t know what was to the right of the picture.  The furthest right copse of trees is great though.  If your lens was strong enough, a crop of just them would have been very neat. 7</td>', 'A nice simple landscape.  Maybe less of the big black section would have been nice, but I don''t know what was to the right of the picture.  The furthest right copse of trees is great though.  If your lens was strong enough, a crop of just them would have been very neat. 7', '2005-11-01 14:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830163, 250879, 44268, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to find the transparency (even though the title hints at it)... but now I can''t look at the picture without having those eyes staring at me. Haunting...</td>', 'Took me a while to find the transparency (even though the title hints at it)... but now I can''t look at the picture without having those eyes staring at me. Haunting...', '2005-11-01 14:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830213, 250879, 13026, '<td valign="top">Joey?<br/>Did I find you?<br/>Freaky eye thing you got going on here, pretty neat.  :)<br/>----<br/>coming back--<br/>i DID find you!  ha!  this is why you renamed your "Nightmare Love" collection the "Scary Face" collection, isn''t it?  ; )<br/>I''s so freakin smart.<br/></td>', 'Joey?Did I find you?Freaky eye thing you got going on here, pretty neat.  :)----coming back--i DID find you!  ha!  this is why you renamed your "Nightmare Love" collection the "Scary Face" collection, isn''t it?  ; )I''s so freakin smart.', '2005-11-01 15:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830217, 251456, 40718, '<td valign="top">A neat abstract.  Are people hammering you for it not being "transparent"?  I''m being very lenient on this challenge so I''ll assume that you can at least sorta see through that object (whatever it is).  The technicals are well done. 7..rikki?</td>', 'A neat abstract.  Are people hammering you for it not being "transparent"?  I''m being very lenient on this challenge so I''ll assume that you can at least sorta see through that object (whatever it is).  The technicals are well done. 7..rikki?', '2005-11-01 15:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830221, 250819, 23430, '<td valign="top">Good shot I think the centred image hepls here</td>', 'Good shot I think the centred image hepls here', '2005-11-01 15:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830224, 249932, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed shot though the two subjects seem a little unrelated</td>', 'Nicely executed shot though the two subjects seem a little unrelated', '2005-11-01 15:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830228, 250774, 23430, '<td valign="top">Composition and background look good but I don''t get it</td>', 'Composition and background look good but I don''t get it', '2005-11-01 15:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830287, 250879, 36563, '<td valign="top">Oh at first I didn''t realize what you had done here, but once I did.. "eek!" Very clever and very fitting for the Halloween season!</td>', 'Oh at first I didn''t realize what you had done here, but once I did.. "eek!" Very clever and very fitting for the Halloween season!', '2005-11-01 15:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830291, 249349, 30881, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image! Wonderful color and lighting. Everything is working in this one Hope to see it at the top</td>', 'Fantastic image! Wonderful color and lighting. Everything is working in this one Hope to see it at the top', '2005-11-01 15:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830304, 251344, 42808, '<td valign="top">yep, they are transparencies--literally. Interesting  and unique capture and the title is so relevant.</td>', 'yep, they are transparencies--literally. Interesting  and unique capture and the title is so relevant.', '2005-11-01 15:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830311, 250625, 42808, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot--good colors and tones. For some reason, I wish it was a bit sharper--but great capture!</td>', 'This is a cool shot--good colors and tones. For some reason, I wish it was a bit sharper--but great capture!', '2005-11-01 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830313, 250671, 17507, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the challenge. I think the orange cast is appropriate for a nighttime scene. Might have been nice to see a bit greater contrast between the highlights and shadows.</td>', 'interesting take on the challenge. I think the orange cast is appropriate for a nighttime scene. Might have been nice to see a bit greater contrast between the highlights and shadows.', '2005-11-01 16:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830316, 251388, 17507, '<td valign="top">nice and weird. lovely gas mask. looks like this pic could have used a bit of sharpening.</td>', 'nice and weird. lovely gas mask. looks like this pic could have used a bit of sharpening.', '2005-11-01 16:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830320, 250088, 17507, '<td valign="top">if this is actually transparent, I really can''t tell - maybe putting it on a differently colored background, like red, would have made it clearer</td>', 'if this is actually transparent, I really can''t tell - maybe putting it on a differently colored background, like red, would have made it clearer', '2005-11-01 16:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830324, 251531, 17507, '<td valign="top">I feel like in terms of thematic quality, this is 90% reflection and 10% transparency. For this challenge, it should be the other way around.</td>', 'I feel like in terms of thematic quality, this is 90% reflection and 10% transparency. For this challenge, it should be the other way around.', '2005-11-01 16:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830325, 249981, 43031, '<td valign="top">that''s awesome</td>', 'that''s awesome', '2005-11-01 16:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830326, 251493, 17507, '<td valign="top">great colors. I like the soft focus.</td>', 'great colors. I like the soft focus.', '2005-11-01 16:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830327, 251126, 17507, '<td valign="top">excellent take on the theme. I really like this - good work.</td>', 'excellent take on the theme. I really like this - good work.', '2005-11-01 16:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830342, 251463, 16106, '<td valign="top">The colors are off here; nice shot but the yellows take over</td>', 'The colors are off here; nice shot but the yellows take over', '2005-11-01 16:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830348, 250775, 14211, '<td valign="top">This is awesome.....Fantastic setup! I would love to see inside this houseI...It deserves a 10++++++</td>', 'This is awesome.....Fantastic setup! I would love to see inside this houseI...It deserves a 10++++++', '2005-11-01 16:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830350, 249432, 16106, '<td valign="top">the orange beverage ( mimosa?) takes away from a good shot. It would have worked on more levels if the fluid was transparent, water wine, champagne, any thing that wasn''t opaque.</td>', 'the orange beverage ( mimosa?) takes away from a good shot. It would have worked on more levels if the fluid was transparent, water wine, champagne, any thing that wasn''t opaque.', '2005-11-01 16:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830373, 250451, 16106, '<td valign="top">clearly the winner. though i am tired of checkerboards garnering blue ribbons, this one is worthy. I wish the corner where vertical met horizontal was a bit less harsh, but that is the only complaint.</td>', 'clearly the winner. though i am tired of checkerboards garnering blue ribbons, this one is worthy. I wish the corner where vertical met horizontal was a bit less harsh, but that is the only complaint.', '2005-11-01 16:26:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1830377, 250949, 16106, '<td valign="top">Shame the cuff want simpler, ditto with the writting on the shirt, but fine idea and great post processing work. ought ot be right near the top.</td>', 'Shame the cuff want simpler, ditto with the writting on the shirt, but fine idea and great post processing work. ought ot be right near the top.', '2005-11-01 16:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830380, 249981, 16106, '<td valign="top">I am sick to death of water drop shots, so to create such a strong image using a subject that I am beginning to hate is an amazing achivment, which i put down to great set up and perfect lighting, not to mention a unique POV. wow</td>', 'I am sick to death of water drop shots, so to create such a strong image using a subject that I am beginning to hate is an amazing achivment, which i put down to great set up and perfect lighting, not to mention a unique POV. wow', '2005-11-01 16:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830427, 250689, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great photograph, love the movement created.</td>', 'Great photograph, love the movement created.', '2005-11-01 16:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830431, 251550, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice original photograph, love the color.</td>', 'Very nice original photograph, love the color.', '2005-11-01 16:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830441, 251197, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, Great picture. Love the ghost like appearance of the dog. The setting is just classic for this type of sceen. Nice use of space. Love the texture and colors too. Very soothing.</td>', 'Wow, Great picture. Love the ghost like appearance of the dog. The setting is just classic for this type of sceen. Nice use of space. Love the texture and colors too. Very soothing.', '2005-11-01 17:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830444, 251044, 42638, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Love the lines and the watch with reference to the title.</td>', 'Excellent! Love the lines and the watch with reference to the title.', '2005-11-01 17:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830447, 249920, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Love the spectrum and the reverse through the glasses. Love how the imperfection of the glass really accentuates the lines.</td>', 'Very nicely done. Love the spectrum and the reverse through the glasses. Love how the imperfection of the glass really accentuates the lines.', '2005-11-01 17:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830488, 251245, 41554, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm, Porto...</td>', 'Mmmmm, Porto...', '2005-11-01 17:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830493, 251044, 42808, '<td valign="top">Great image and perspective--wonderful</td>', 'Great image and perspective--wonderful', '2005-11-01 17:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830516, 251385, 46778, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2005-11-01 17:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830518, 250941, 46778, '<td valign="top">neat shoot</td>', 'neat shoot', '2005-11-01 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830525, 249981, 46778, '<td valign="top">very interesting shoot, how many times did it take to get it right?</td>', 'very interesting shoot, how many times did it take to get it right?', '2005-11-01 17:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830527, 250376, 46778, '<td valign="top">clever thought</td>', 'clever thought', '2005-11-01 17:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830529, 250671, 46778, '<td valign="top">Like the message behind the picture.</td>', 'Like the message behind the picture.', '2005-11-01 17:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830667, 251409, 42968, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast from the well defined subject and the obscure background. The picture also has a very "mysterious" aspect to it, as it really catches your eye. The "look" in the eyes is absolutely "pleading for help" along with some sadness. The eyes are well seen however, where is the mouth? This adds to the mysterious look. Transparancy.....is in the over all look of this photo. What do you see through this scary mask? Not evil, but a human who ended up in the wrong place. Nice Job-ster. Can''t vote on the "Member Challeng" however if I could, I would go with a BIG 9.</td>', 'I really like the contrast from the well defined subject and the obscure background. The picture also has a very "mysterious" aspect to it, as it really catches your eye. The "look" in the eyes is absolutely "pleading for help" along with some sadness. The eyes are well seen however, where is the mouth? This adds to the mysterious look. Transparancy.....is in the over all look of this photo. What do you see through this scary mask? Not evil, but a human who ended up in the wrong place. Nice Job-ster. Can''t vote on the "Member Challeng" however if I could, I would go with a BIG 9.', '2005-11-01 18:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830703, 250936, 32033, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo and am sorry for giving a lower score.  I feel the photo would have benefited with the greater portion of the veil covering the right side of her face. Very nice.</td>', 'I really like this photo and am sorry for giving a lower score.  I feel the photo would have benefited with the greater portion of the veil covering the right side of her face. Very nice.', '2005-11-01 18:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830708, 248870, 32033, '<td valign="top">The bubbles continuing out the top of the glass is really good.  I feel a different lighting / background would have made the photo better.</td>', 'The bubbles continuing out the top of the glass is really good.  I feel a different lighting / background would have made the photo better.', '2005-11-01 18:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830732, 251364, 44176, '<td valign="top">I love how you can feel her slight smile...excelent photo.</td>', 'I love how you can feel her slight smile...excelent photo.', '2005-11-01 18:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830753, 250879, 43116, '<td valign="top">wow that is so freaky and awesome!</td>', 'wow that is so freaky and awesome!', '2005-11-01 18:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830764, 250999, 42005, '<td valign="top">So Clever!</td>', 'So Clever!', '2005-11-01 18:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830847, 250662, 38725, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, nice colours &amp; interesting angle, but IMHO there is more reflection than transparency going on here.</td>', 'Lovely shot, nice colours & interesting angle, but IMHO there is more reflection than transparency going on here.', '2005-11-01 19:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830859, 251020, 38725, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colour, very nice shot.</td>', 'Beautiful colour, very nice shot.', '2005-11-01 19:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830880, 251004, 40718, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  The background is a bit odd.  Lighting is nice though.</td>', 'Cute idea.  The background is a bit odd.  Lighting is nice though.', '2005-11-01 19:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830884, 250775, 40718, '<td valign="top">Creatively done.  Having actual glass in the frame (is this a storm window) is nice because you get the reflection which, I think, adds rather than sutracts.  I''m usually a fan of selective desat or I guess sectional desat. 7</td>', 'Creatively done.  Having actual glass in the frame (is this a storm window) is nice because you get the reflection which, I think, adds rather than sutracts.  I''m usually a fan of selective desat or I guess sectional desat. 7', '2005-11-01 19:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830885, 249329, 40718, '<td valign="top">Tough, tough lighting.  You mostly pulled it off, but the mild scratches in the glass take away a bit.  I think I would have liked more lighting on the front of the angel.</td>', 'Tough, tough lighting.  You mostly pulled it off, but the mild scratches in the glass take away a bit.  I think I would have liked more lighting on the front of the angel.', '2005-11-01 19:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830889, 251169, 40718, '<td valign="top">The good: Nicely lit.  No reflection on the umbrella, that probably took some work.<br/>To work on: Well, the subject isn''t all that interesting.  Without the title, it doesn''t send much message.</td>', 'The good: Nicely lit.  No reflection on the umbrella, that probably took some work.To work on: Well, the subject isn''t all that interesting.  Without the title, it doesn''t send much message.', '2005-11-01 19:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830892, 251147, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is a picture which is nice, but the transparency adds nothing but qualifying it for the challenge.  I''d like to see this shot without the glass and in a differernt challenge.</td>', 'This is a picture which is nice, but the transparency adds nothing but qualifying it for the challenge.  I''d like to see this shot without the glass and in a differernt challenge.', '2005-11-01 19:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830893, 251003, 40718, '<td valign="top">The window shade adds, but the chairs and telephone don''t (despite the title).  I''d ditch those next time. 6</td>', 'The window shade adds, but the chairs and telephone don''t (despite the title).  I''d ditch those next time. 6', '2005-11-01 19:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830896, 250854, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is one where I''m just left not thinking too much good or bad.  I think, ultimately, you did as much as you could with the subject, but it doesn''t get you where you want to go.</td>', 'This is one where I''m just left not thinking too much good or bad.  I think, ultimately, you did as much as you could with the subject, but it doesn''t get you where you want to go.', '2005-11-01 19:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
