(1831429, 251311, 44086, '<td valign="top">This shot is so well thought out. But, post processing the drama would be more focused if you cloned out the scratches and marks and the trim. They distract from your subject rather than frame it.</td>', 'This shot is so well thought out. But, post processing the drama would be more focused if you cloned out the scratches and marks and the trim. They distract from your subject rather than frame it.', '2005-11-01 23:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
