(1831852, 251374, 40718, '<td valign="top">Ya, ok, you can just take your ribbon home now...I''m gonna ponder the technique in this one for a while.  I''ll figure it out eventually. ;) 10  Is this a graphicfunk?<br/>Finally figured it out...the center is not the mirror, the outside is...</td>', 'Ya, ok, you can just take your ribbon home now...I''m gonna ponder the technique in this one for a while.  I''ll figure it out eventually. ;) 10  Is this a graphicfunk?Finally figured it out...the center is not the mirror, the outside is...', '2005-11-02 01:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832034, 249128, 39629, '<td valign="top">Great shot, novel slant on transparency</td>', 'Great shot, novel slant on transparency', '2005-11-02 03:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832043, 250361, 45241, '<td valign="top">underexposed, what is the subject?</td>', 'underexposed, what is the subject?', '2005-11-02 03:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832056, 251580, 45241, '<td valign="top">decent compostion but so underexposed</td>', 'decent compostion but so underexposed', '2005-11-02 03:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832271, 250956, 33352, '<td valign="top">Before I can vote on this as a transparency , need to know more about the northen lights,and how they are seen as a see through image. Like the image and think it is well taken, with good leading lines, and depth, come back to me with a good explanation.Thank you for your explanation,can now understand the correct effect, am bumping .......5 to 9</td>', 'Before I can vote on this as a transparency , need to know more about the northen lights,and how they are seen as a see through image. Like the image and think it is well taken, with good leading lines, and depth, come back to me with a good explanation.Thank you for your explanation,can now understand the correct effect, am bumping .......5 to 9', '2005-11-02 08:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832304, 251075, 21714, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful. Excellent control of settings and exposure. Most wonderful photography. Very impressive work. An image that deserves all the praise.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful. Excellent control of settings and exposure. Most wonderful photography. Very impressive work. An image that deserves all the praise.', '2005-11-02 08:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832385, 251359, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the leaves in the glass, but for me, I find the very stark white background too much of a contrast.</td>', 'I like the leaves in the glass, but for me, I find the very stark white background too much of a contrast.', '2005-11-02 08:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832388, 250539, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting setup. I''d be curious to know how you did this after the challenge is over. I find that bit of green around the skull''s teeth distracting, and for me, I think cropping out the partial pumpkin at the top would work better.</td>', 'Interesting setup. I''d be curious to know how you did this after the challenge is over. I find that bit of green around the skull''s teeth distracting, and for me, I think cropping out the partial pumpkin at the top would work better.', '2005-11-02 08:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832392, 250999, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I like it. In fact, the more I look at it, the more I like it. I like the color tones you chose. The upper left corner is a bit bright, but still a very cool photo. Well done. 8</td>', 'Interesting. I like it. In fact, the more I look at it, the more I like it. I like the color tones you chose. The upper left corner is a bit bright, but still a very cool photo. Well done. 8', '2005-11-02 08:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832396, 250689, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your photo gives me a good journalistic feel - kind of a gritty, inner city quality. I like the lighting and the way you made it all black and white except the one person - clever and good use of a photo editing program.</td>', 'Your photo gives me a good journalistic feel - kind of a gritty, inner city quality. I like the lighting and the way you made it all black and white except the one person - clever and good use of a photo editing program.', '2005-11-02 08:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832416, 249981, 35804, '<td valign="top">I have to say I''m not a huge fan of the water drop shots...but this is awesome! The "op art" background and reflections make this, nice lighting too...what a great idea.</td>', 'I have to say I''m not a huge fan of the water drop shots...but this is awesome! The "op art" background and reflections make this, nice lighting too...what a great idea.', '2005-11-02 09:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832417, 250366, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the building itself and you''ve nicely captured the morning light.</td>', 'I like the building itself and you''ve nicely captured the morning light.', '2005-11-02 09:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832419, 250267, 35804, '<td valign="top">I just love the light and tones of this shot...very dark with a twist of sensual...very nice.</td>', 'I just love the light and tones of this shot...very dark with a twist of sensual...very nice.', '2005-11-02 09:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832422, 249650, 41675, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of your photo is the bottom half. The clouds at the top look a bit too bright (to me), but a very cool shot. What a beautiful vantage point.</td>', 'My favorite part of your photo is the bottom half. The clouds at the top look a bit too bright (to me), but a very cool shot. What a beautiful vantage point.', '2005-11-02 09:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832427, 250088, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the white is overblown a bit and although the rose is made of glass, I don''t get the same transparency sense from your photo as I do from other entries. I do like the composition though.</td>', 'For me, the white is overblown a bit and although the rose is made of glass, I don''t get the same transparency sense from your photo as I do from other entries. I do like the composition though.', '2005-11-02 09:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832435, 251046, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the background makes this shot work well. That and the contrasting color flower. If the vases were a bit more in focus (yeah, I''m one of those voters who likes sharp images) I would have scored it even higher. Very well done though, and good luck in the challenge. 7</td>', 'For me, the background makes this shot work well. That and the contrasting color flower. If the vases were a bit more in focus (yeah, I''m one of those voters who likes sharp images) I would have scored it even higher. Very well done though, and good luck in the challenge. 7', '2005-11-02 09:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832438, 251268, 35804, '<td valign="top">Very interesting...love the tonality and comp...very nice.</td>', 'Very interesting...love the tonality and comp...very nice.', '2005-11-02 09:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832444, 250729, 35804, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the way the light dances...this is just so easy to look at...the is something very "soothing" about this image.</td>', 'Love the colors and the way the light dances...this is just so easy to look at...the is something very "soothing" about this image.', '2005-11-02 09:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832458, 250689, 35804, '<td valign="top">...cool...very very cool...absolutely one of my favs.</td>', '...cool...very very cool...absolutely one of my favs.', '2005-11-02 09:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832522, 250999, 35804, '<td valign="top">...excellent...love this...10.</td>', '...excellent...love this...10.', '2005-11-02 09:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832540, 250879, 41522, '<td valign="top">Definitely creepy. Excellent grunge look.  Maybe a litle less hair over the left eye might have given a little more visibility to that eye.  Good work.</td>', 'Definitely creepy. Excellent grunge look.  Maybe a litle less hair over the left eye might have given a little more visibility to that eye.  Good work.', '2005-11-02 09:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832551, 250977, 41522, '<td valign="top">The ripples over the foot are very cool.  The neck area looks to me to be blown out.  For me, I would have also liked to have seen more of the face.  JMO.</td>', 'The ripples over the foot are very cool.  The neck area looks to me to be blown out.  For me, I would have also liked to have seen more of the face.  JMO.', '2005-11-02 09:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832617, 250774, 41522, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the assignment.  The light reflecting off the celophane is distracting for me.  It would have been nice if we could have seen through a lile more.  JMO.</td>', 'An interesting take on the assignment.  The light reflecting off the celophane is distracting for me.  It would have been nice if we could have seen through a lile more.  JMO.', '2005-11-02 10:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832626, 250671, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yes.  A double!  Homeless (Transparent) and Ghostly forms (Transparent).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Yes.  A double!  Homeless (Transparent) and Ghostly forms (Transparent).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-11-02 10:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832655, 251282, 16241, '<td valign="top">oooooh  jason?</td>', 'oooooh  jason?', '2005-11-02 10:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832669, 249842, 16241, '<td valign="top">clever!</td>', 'clever!', '2005-11-02 10:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832701, 251346, 41522, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept of this shot.  The difference in tones from the window pane and the real world is very nice.  I think I would have liked this shot more if everything in the image were in sharper focus.  JMO</td>', 'I really like the concept of this shot.  The difference in tones from the window pane and the real world is very nice.  I think I would have liked this shot more if everything in the image were in sharper focus.  JMO', '2005-11-02 10:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832704, 251074, 41522, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I really like that you''ve captured something that is symmetric and assymmetric at the sametime.  Nicely composed   Good saturation.</td>', 'Very nice.  I really like that you''ve captured something that is symmetric and assymmetric at the sametime.  Nicely composed   Good saturation.', '2005-11-02 10:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832714, 249349, 41522, '<td valign="top">A nice natural still life shot.  The colours are great and technically there is nothing to complain about.  For me, this shot isn''t as strong a Transparency photo as some of the other photos.  Only the large pools of water are transparent, while the small drops don''t give the impression of transpareny.  Still, a very good shot with good exposure/processing.  I still gave it a good rating.</td>', 'A nice natural still life shot.  The colours are great and technically there is nothing to complain about.  For me, this shot isn''t as strong a Transparency photo as some of the other photos.  Only the large pools of water are transparent, while the small drops don''t give the impression of transpareny.  Still, a very good shot with good exposure/processing.  I still gave it a good rating.', '2005-11-02 10:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832720, 251021, 41522, '<td valign="top">I happen to be a fan of abstract photography and I think this is a good one  I think you''ve don a go job to show the texture of the water while not allowing it to become reflective.  Also, god work on cropping to make a nice composition with the background colours and shapes.  Good work.</td>', 'I happen to be a fan of abstract photography and I think this is a good one  I think you''ve don a go job to show the texture of the water while not allowing it to become reflective.  Also, god work on cropping to make a nice composition with the background colours and shapes.  Good work.', '2005-11-02 10:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832730, 251311, 41522, '<td valign="top">Overall, a very nice photo.  I like the subtle nature of the silhouette.  I think it was right to include some of the shower door edge, but I find that I''m struggling a little bit with accepting the difference in the chrome versus the texture of the door with the silhouette.  Maybe if there were a little less of the door edge.  JMHO.</td>', 'Overall, a very nice photo.  I like the subtle nature of the silhouette.  I think it was right to include some of the shower door edge, but I find that I''m struggling a little bit with accepting the difference in the chrome versus the texture of the door with the silhouette.  Maybe if there were a little less of the door edge.  JMHO.', '2005-11-02 10:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832742, 249985, 41522, '<td valign="top">Very nice fractal art piece.  I like the selective desat. work.  Very interesting piece.  Nicely composed.  I like the balance of the shot and that you used an odd number for both the foreground and backround elements.  I wonder if that was done concisously or not?  God work.</td>', 'Very nice fractal art piece.  I like the selective desat. work.  Very interesting piece.  Nicely composed.  I like the balance of the shot and that you used an odd number for both the foreground and backround elements.  I wonder if that was done concisously or not?  God work.', '2005-11-02 10:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832755, 250274, 41522, '<td valign="top">Overall, a nice photo.  The focus s good and the composition is pleasing.  I think that you could have gotten away with a slightly brighter lighting setup ... I think it might have really brought out the veining in the fruit and made the colours just a bit brighter.  JMO.</td>', 'Overall, a nice photo.  The focus s good and the composition is pleasing.  I think that you could have gotten away with a slightly brighter lighting setup ... I think it might have really brought out the veining in the fruit and made the colours just a bit brighter.  JMO.', '2005-11-02 10:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832777, 250983, 41522, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve done a very good job with your transparetn desktop shot.</td>', 'I think you''ve done a very good job with your transparetn desktop shot.', '2005-11-02 10:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832819, 249663, 41522, '<td valign="top">I rally like this type of photo. For me, I would have liked to have seen a stronger silhoutte of the frog.  Not sure if that means a sronger light source or not.</td>', 'I rally like this type of photo. For me, I would have liked to have seen a stronger silhoutte of the frog.  Not sure if that means a sronger light source or not.', '2005-11-02 11:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832823, 251403, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the way that the eyes stand out, but the more I look at this, the more I can see that this appears to have been blurred with the eyes masked out. The gauze in front of the eyes appears more strongly defined there than in the rest of the frame. I find that a little distracting. The lovely smile is nice to see, though.</td>', 'I like the way that the eyes stand out, but the more I look at this, the more I can see that this appears to have been blurred with the eyes masked out. The gauze in front of the eyes appears more strongly defined there than in the rest of the frame. I find that a little distracting. The lovely smile is nice to see, though.', '2005-11-02 11:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832828, 251438, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great idea, well shot.I particularly like the positioning of the glasses, so that the baby''s eyes appear framed in the lens.</td>', 'Great idea, well shot.I particularly like the positioning of the glasses, so that the baby''s eyes appear framed in the lens.', '2005-11-02 11:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832834, 250759, 24212, '<td valign="top">Nicely controlled lighting. There is a small speck in the upper right that intrudes a bit (really being petty now, aren''t I?).</td>', 'Nicely controlled lighting. There is a small speck in the upper right that intrudes a bit (really being petty now, aren''t I?).', '2005-11-02 11:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832835, 251580, 41522, '<td valign="top">I think you tried something very difficult here.  I''m guessing by the low light of the photo,you were tring to get a sharp focus on the flame, as that is really the only element of the photo that is seen through the transparency of the glass.  The low light of he photo has made it look like the photo is blurry.  JMO</td>', 'I think you tried something very difficult here.  I''m guessing by the low light of the photo,you were tring to get a sharp focus on the flame, as that is really the only element of the photo that is seen through the transparency of the glass.  The low light of he photo has made it look like the photo is blurry.  JMO', '2005-11-02 11:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832841, 251455, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, it looks as though the focus is on the tree in the background. This means that the lamp itself is a little out of focus, which I find somewhat distracting.</td>', 'To me, it looks as though the focus is on the tree in the background. This means that the lamp itself is a little out of focus, which I find somewhat distracting.', '2005-11-02 11:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832849, 250994, 24212, '<td valign="top">I looks to me as though this was taken on a seriously overcast day. I would prefer to see this with a little more saturation.</td>', 'I looks to me as though this was taken on a seriously overcast day. I would prefer to see this with a little more saturation.', '2005-11-02 11:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832881, 251168, 24212, '<td valign="top">I quite like the angle chosen here, although I''m not sure about the texture of the background.</td>', 'I quite like the angle chosen here, although I''m not sure about the texture of the background.', '2005-11-02 11:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832887, 250274, 24212, '<td valign="top">I rather like the tight framing here.</td>', 'I rather like the tight framing here.', '2005-11-02 11:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832892, 251197, 24212, '<td valign="top">A clever take on transparency indeed.</td>', 'A clever take on transparency indeed.', '2005-11-02 11:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832895, 251311, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lighting really helps convey the image of the figure behind the glass. If anything, I feel that there is a little too much of the doorframe to the right of the image.</td>', 'The lighting really helps convey the image of the figure behind the glass. If anything, I feel that there is a little too much of the doorframe to the right of the image.', '2005-11-02 11:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832901, 251039, 24212, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.</td>', 'Clever idea.', '2005-11-02 11:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832904, 250625, 24212, '<td valign="top">The colours here are wonderful. The images of the flower through the water droplets are really interesting to look at.</td>', 'The colours here are wonderful. The images of the flower through the water droplets are really interesting to look at.', '2005-11-02 11:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832906, 250267, 24212, '<td valign="top">This seems a little too dark for my liking in the central portion of the frame.</td>', 'This seems a little too dark for my liking in the central portion of the frame.', '2005-11-02 11:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832909, 251288, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and the playing of the light on the leaves through the water. The only slight nagging thing I find is the patch of brightness on the leaf in the top right.</td>', 'I like the colours and the playing of the light on the leaves through the water. The only slight nagging thing I find is the patch of brightness on the leaf in the top right.', '2005-11-02 11:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832911, 251583, 24212, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, although the ''window frames'' seem a little unevenly lit, to my eye.</td>', 'Interesting effect, although the ''window frames'' seem a little unevenly lit, to my eye.', '2005-11-02 11:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832917, 251475, 24212, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, great how you managed to eliminate any motion blur on the seated figure. I presume that this was a long exposure and the chap either entered the frame or left the frame half way through.</td>', 'Neat idea, great how you managed to eliminate any motion blur on the seated figure. I presume that this was a long exposure and the chap either entered the frame or left the frame half way through.', '2005-11-02 11:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832925, 250650, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the way that the reflections in the glass in the upper half provide some straight lines to counterpoint the curves and in the lower half provide some softness to break up what would otherwise be a plain and boring wall.</td>', 'I like the way that the reflections in the glass in the upper half provide some straight lines to counterpoint the curves and in the lower half provide some softness to break up what would otherwise be a plain and boring wall.', '2005-11-02 11:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832931, 250435, 24212, '<td valign="top">Cleverly done, although I would consider cropping off a little from the top, as the dark wedge at the top right is a little unnecessary, I feel.</td>', 'Cleverly done, although I would consider cropping off a little from the top, as the dark wedge at the top right is a little unnecessary, I feel.', '2005-11-02 11:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832933, 251075, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting here is absolutely brilliant. I particularly love the way that the face darkens from left to right and leads into the negative space.</td>', 'I think the lighting here is absolutely brilliant. I particularly love the way that the face darkens from left to right and leads into the negative space.', '2005-11-02 11:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832950, 249432, 24212, '<td valign="top">Nicely sharp around the eye, although there are a couple of reflections in the glass and one in the eye that are a bit too strong for my liking. Possibly the lighting from the left was a little too harsh. I think that the hair to the left of the frame looks a little unruly and could be cropped off and I also feel that the unused earring hole coould be cloned out (I keep finding my eye drawn to it). Still a good shot though.</td>', 'Nicely sharp around the eye, although there are a couple of reflections in the glass and one in the eye that are a bit too strong for my liking. Possibly the lighting from the left was a little too harsh. I think that the hair to the left of the frame looks a little unruly and could be cropped off and I also feel that the unused earring hole coould be cloned out (I keep finding my eye drawn to it). Still a good shot though.', '2005-11-02 11:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832959, 251364, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the tight crop here, although I wonder whether a little additional sharpening around the eyes would give them just a hint more sparkle.</td>', 'I like the tight crop here, although I wonder whether a little additional sharpening around the eyes would give them just a hint more sparkle.', '2005-11-02 11:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832965, 248905, 24212, '<td valign="top">While the drop is nicely in focus, the backgound, being so out of focus, detracts from this image in my opinion.</td>', 'While the drop is nicely in focus, the backgound, being so out of focus, detracts from this image in my opinion.', '2005-11-02 11:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832969, 251274, 24212, '<td valign="top">This is the sort of family shot that I can imagine you had fun in taking. I think that the space to the left of the head works really well and love the sense of fun conveyed here.</td>', 'This is the sort of family shot that I can imagine you had fun in taking. I think that the space to the left of the head works really well and love the sense of fun conveyed here.', '2005-11-02 11:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832977, 250936, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the rich tones, although I''m not sure about the crease in the veil passing over the right eye. The eye is neither fully obscured nor fully visible and I find this spoils the effect a little.</td>', 'I like the rich tones, although I''m not sure about the crease in the veil passing over the right eye. The eye is neither fully obscured nor fully visible and I find this spoils the effect a little.', '2005-11-02 11:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832982, 251385, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that this could do with a little more sharpening, to really bring out the detail.</td>', 'I feel that this could do with a little more sharpening, to really bring out the detail.', '2005-11-02 11:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832991, 251501, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the delicate tones of this shot although I wonder whether a crop in from the right might work as well, as I find that the darker tones around the right side draw attention away from the eye.</td>', 'I like the delicate tones of this shot although I wonder whether a crop in from the right might work as well, as I find that the darker tones around the right side draw attention away from the eye.', '2005-11-02 11:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1832995, 250460, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the colour and the framing, although I feel that a little extra sharpening would not go amiss.</td>', 'I like the colour and the framing, although I feel that a little extra sharpening would not go amiss.', '2005-11-02 11:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833000, 251017, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the framing. The subtle dashes of colour in the rest of the frame really help set off the brightly (back)lit leaf.</td>', 'I really like the framing. The subtle dashes of colour in the rest of the frame really help set off the brightly (back)lit leaf.', '2005-11-02 11:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833007, 250563, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections in the glass as well. I find that the stray face in the top left draws attention away from the window-dresser.</td>', 'I like the reflections in the glass as well. I find that the stray face in the top left draws attention away from the window-dresser.', '2005-11-02 12:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833014, 249993, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and background, although I''d like to see perhaps a little more DOF, as the bottle at the front is going a little out of focus at the base.</td>', 'Great lighting and background, although I''d like to see perhaps a little more DOF, as the bottle at the front is going a little out of focus at the base.', '2005-11-02 12:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833016, 249296, 24212, '<td valign="top">I find the simple pattern with the bold lines quite pleasant.</td>', 'I find the simple pattern with the bold lines quite pleasant.', '2005-11-02 12:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833022, 249523, 24212, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that the bubbles and the bright reflections really help the overall effect.</td>', 'I''m not sure that the bubbles and the bright reflections really help the overall effect.', '2005-11-02 12:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833028, 250741, 24212, '<td valign="top">I love shots like this. Normally I find it very difficult to avoid blown-out highlights doing shots like this.I cannot see any here. Detail is superb.</td>', 'I love shots like this. Normally I find it very difficult to avoid blown-out highlights doing shots like this.I cannot see any here. Detail is superb.', '2005-11-02 12:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833034, 251310, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the lighting works really well here.</td>', 'I think that the lighting works really well here.', '2005-11-02 12:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833038, 251435, 24212, '<td valign="top">A really clever take. I''ll bet that this took some setting up, so that it looked right.</td>', 'A really clever take. I''ll bet that this took some setting up, so that it looked right.', '2005-11-02 12:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833042, 250983, 24212, '<td valign="top">This is wonderfully done. I particularly like the lighting around the laptop, giving the whole thing a very dark feel.</td>', 'This is wonderfully done. I particularly like the lighting around the laptop, giving the whole thing a very dark feel.', '2005-11-02 12:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833045, 251177, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the reflection of the shed (or is it a fence?) in the window pane top left rather drowns out the face and overpowers the rest of the shot.</td>', 'I think that the reflection of the shed (or is it a fence?) in the window pane top left rather drowns out the face and overpowers the rest of the shot.', '2005-11-02 12:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833050, 251245, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the lighting and background are well done, although the more I look at this, the more I wish that the glass were in sharper focus. Probably very difficult to achieve, though.</td>', 'I think that the lighting and background are well done, although the more I look at this, the more I wish that the glass were in sharper focus. Probably very difficult to achieve, though.', '2005-11-02 12:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833058, 251458, 24212, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is through which the leaf is being viewed and, without any frame of reference, the picture looks, on a first glance at least, just to be a blurry leaf.</td>', 'I don''t know what it is through which the leaf is being viewed and, without any frame of reference, the picture looks, on a first glance at least, just to be a blurry leaf.', '2005-11-02 12:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833060, 249307, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the patterns in the water have been captured well here.</td>', 'I think that the patterns in the water have been captured well here.', '2005-11-02 12:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833066, 251280, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the composition is rather good and that the selective desaturation works really well. Great thoughtful expressions on the models'' faces.</td>', 'I think that the composition is rather good and that the selective desaturation works really well. Great thoughtful expressions on the models'' faces.', '2005-11-02 12:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833067, 250973, 24212, '<td valign="top">For me, there is too much plain darkness at the top and the bottom of the frame.</td>', 'For me, there is too much plain darkness at the top and the bottom of the frame.', '2005-11-02 12:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833069, 251453, 24212, '<td valign="top">A lovely splash of colour and a good balancing trick.</td>', 'A lovely splash of colour and a good balancing trick.', '2005-11-02 12:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833111, 250879, 24212, '<td valign="top">It took me quite a while to ''get'' this image. I''m glad I spent some time to look at it. Very well done.</td>', 'It took me quite a while to ''get'' this image. I''m glad I spent some time to look at it. Very well done.', '2005-11-02 12:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833119, 251448, 24212, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, framing -wise, although it just looks a little empty to me with nothing to really grab my attention.</td>', 'Interesting shot, framing -wise, although it just looks a little empty to me with nothing to really grab my attention.', '2005-11-02 12:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833121, 250754, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lighting is good, although the edges of the disc seem to blend into the background a little.</td>', 'The lighting is good, although the edges of the disc seem to blend into the background a little.', '2005-11-02 12:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833124, 250918, 24212, '<td valign="top">I didn''t really get a sense of the scale of this until I noticed the towers on the left of the frame.</td>', 'I didn''t really get a sense of the scale of this until I noticed the towers on the left of the frame.', '2005-11-02 12:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833127, 250361, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and colourful, although the subject matter does not really ''grab'' me.</td>', 'Very sharp and colourful, although the subject matter does not really ''grab'' me.', '2005-11-02 12:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833131, 250002, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very well set up. Great expression.</td>', 'Very well set up. Great expression.', '2005-11-02 12:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833133, 251346, 24212, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and well executed.</td>', 'Clever idea and well executed.', '2005-11-02 12:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833138, 251405, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very subtle. I get the sense of an optical illusion when looking at this- the figure behind the glass seems to be moving. Perhaps I need an eye test.</td>', 'Very subtle. I get the sense of an optical illusion when looking at this- the figure behind the glass seems to be moving. Perhaps I need an eye test.', '2005-11-02 12:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833141, 248820, 24212, '<td valign="top">Simple shot done well.</td>', 'Simple shot done well.', '2005-11-02 12:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833144, 250878, 24212, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between green and orange-brown here, although I feel that the leaf could do with a little extra sharpening.</td>', 'I love the contrast between green and orange-brown here, although I feel that the leaf could do with a little extra sharpening.', '2005-11-02 12:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833145, 251285, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the way that this leads the eye off into the distance, but I feel that some of the reflections in the water spoil it a little.</td>', 'I like the way that this leads the eye off into the distance, but I feel that some of the reflections in the water spoil it a little.', '2005-11-02 12:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833150, 249621, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, the leaves seem a little too bunched. It''s not easy to make out much detail at a first inspection. I like the way that the water flow is diagonal in the frame.</td>', 'To me, the leaves seem a little too bunched. It''s not easy to make out much detail at a first inspection. I like the way that the water flow is diagonal in the frame.', '2005-11-02 12:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833152, 249991, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the idea here is great and the execution is strong, but the background is a little too much. Perhaps a plainer background could have been used or this one could have been blurred a little.</td>', 'I think that the idea here is great and the execution is strong, but the background is a little too much. Perhaps a plainer background could have been used or this one could have been blurred a little.', '2005-11-02 12:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833155, 251460, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the tight framing chosen here, although I''d like to see the frame of the magnifying glass itself a little sharper.</td>', 'I like the tight framing chosen here, although I''d like to see the frame of the magnifying glass itself a little sharper.', '2005-11-02 12:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833164, 251402, 44703, '<td valign="top">Great idea, lovely picture.</td>', 'Great idea, lovely picture.', '2005-11-02 13:02:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1833168, 250983, 44703, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, good job.</td>', 'Nicely composed, good job.', '2005-11-02 13:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833185, 250366, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nicely done with the sunset. 7</td>', 'Nicely done with the sunset. 7', '2005-11-02 13:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833188, 251180, 40718, '<td valign="top">The composition is nice with the bars and the countering of the organic stem.  I do get a watercolor impression, so you succeeded there, but overall the pic doesn''t excite me too much.  I think it''s the muted colors. 6</td>', 'The composition is nice with the bars and the countering of the organic stem.  I do get a watercolor impression, so you succeeded there, but overall the pic doesn''t excite me too much.  I think it''s the muted colors. 6', '2005-11-02 13:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833189, 251459, 40718, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and color.  Nice abstract. 8</td>', 'Good lighting and color.  Nice abstract. 8', '2005-11-02 13:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833191, 249307, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is better than the other "behind the waterfall" as the subjects look like they belong in the picture.  The picture doesn''t have too much "wow" factor, but it''s a nice attempt.</td>', 'This is better than the other "behind the waterfall" as the subjects look like they belong in the picture.  The picture doesn''t have too much "wow" factor, but it''s a nice attempt.', '2005-11-02 13:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833194, 251341, 40718, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, you know the first thing I thought about was that controvertial picture "Jesus in urine".  The apple juice might not have been the best choice. :)  The quarter is nicely focused though and the lighting is nice.</td>', 'Hmmm, you know the first thing I thought about was that controvertial picture "Jesus in urine".  The apple juice might not have been the best choice. :)  The quarter is nicely focused though and the lighting is nice.', '2005-11-02 13:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833197, 251327, 40718, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I think the neat image didn''t really help here.  It''s neat on the door, but I don''t like it on the window.  It makes the dove look OOF.  A cute shot though. 6</td>', 'Hmm, I think the neat image didn''t really help here.  It''s neat on the door, but I don''t like it on the window.  It makes the dove look OOF.  A cute shot though. 6', '2005-11-02 13:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833200, 250671, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is a great commentary picture which is enhanced by the title.  I think it just spoke to me (where many of the other statement pics in this challenge did not).  8</td>', 'This is a great commentary picture which is enhanced by the title.  I think it just spoke to me (where many of the other statement pics in this challenge did not).  8', '2005-11-02 13:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833201, 251485, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is a shot where I ask, "what is the saran adding to the picture?"  I think her pose was a great portrait capture, but the plastic, required to meet the challenge, isn''t helping.  Would have liked to see this in another challenge...6</td>', 'This is a shot where I ask, "what is the saran adding to the picture?"  I think her pose was a great portrait capture, but the plastic, required to meet the challenge, isn''t helping.  Would have liked to see this in another challenge...6', '2005-11-02 13:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833203, 251311, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice and subtle.  The lighting is excellent. 7</td>', 'Nice and subtle.  The lighting is excellent. 7', '2005-11-02 13:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833204, 250774, 40718, '<td valign="top">That doll isn''t getting you too far is it?  Her other pics, I believe, also did not do so well...</td>', 'That doll isn''t getting you too far is it?  Her other pics, I believe, also did not do so well...', '2005-11-02 13:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833208, 248905, 40718, '<td valign="top">The picture is made because the drop is so sharp.  your choice to leave the whole splash OOF is better than had it been partially in focus.  The colors aren''t awesome (they clash a bit), but I like it. 8</td>', 'The picture is made because the drop is so sharp.  your choice to leave the whole splash OOF is better than had it been partially in focus.  The colors aren''t awesome (they clash a bit), but I like it. 8', '2005-11-02 13:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833211, 250361, 40718, '<td valign="top">mundane shapsot. :(  focused well though.</td>', 'mundane shapsot. :(  focused well though.', '2005-11-02 13:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833213, 248820, 40718, '<td valign="top">Has been done, but you executed well. 7</td>', 'Has been done, but you executed well. 7', '2005-11-02 13:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833219, 250203, 40718, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the streak of light going across the canvas.  hard to tell if it''s glare or not.  Perhaps either crop the top of the dish in or out. 5</td>', 'I don''t like the streak of light going across the canvas.  hard to tell if it''s glare or not.  Perhaps either crop the top of the dish in or out. 5', '2005-11-02 13:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833223, 251177, 40718, '<td valign="top">A nicely done "ghost".  I''ve seen a lot, but this one is still fresh.  6</td>', 'A nicely done "ghost".  I''ve seen a lot, but this one is still fresh.  6', '2005-11-02 13:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833232, 250949, 17507, '<td valign="top">looks very Joey Lawrence.</td>', 'looks very Joey Lawrence.', '2005-11-02 13:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833234, 249663, 17507, '<td valign="top">properly speaking, this is translucent, not transparent... love the texture in the palm frond, though</td>', 'properly speaking, this is translucent, not transparent... love the texture in the palm frond, though', '2005-11-02 13:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833242, 248870, 17507, '<td valign="top">interesting work- I''m not quite sure what I''m seeing. A glass submerged in water with some oil droplets thrown in for effect, maybe?</td>', 'interesting work- I''m not quite sure what I''m seeing. A glass submerged in water with some oil droplets thrown in for effect, maybe?', '2005-11-02 13:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833253, 251557, 17507, '<td valign="top">this image is rather confusing. is this a golf cart? though I understand that the windshield is transparent, its transparency is so complete that it plays no compositional role in this image at all.</td>', 'this image is rather confusing. is this a golf cart? though I understand that the windshield is transparent, its transparency is so complete that it plays no compositional role in this image at all.', '2005-11-02 13:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833255, 251458, 17507, '<td valign="top">this looks like a reflection, not an example of transparency...</td>', 'this looks like a reflection, not an example of transparency...', '2005-11-02 13:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833260, 250759, 17507, '<td valign="top">composition could use some work. think about where the lines are going in this picture... they''re converging on a spot in the bottom of the frame. generally speaking, you should arrange your elements so that the focal point is not so close to the edge.</td>', 'composition could use some work. think about where the lines are going in this picture... they''re converging on a spot in the bottom of the frame. generally speaking, you should arrange your elements so that the focal point is not so close to the edge.', '2005-11-02 13:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833265, 251044, 17507, '<td valign="top">this one reminds me of mine - I hope that people are understanding that it''s a clear sphere REFRACTING and not an opaque metallic sphere REFLECTING! this important distinction seems to have escaped the attention of some of those voting on my image... good luck</td>', 'this one reminds me of mine - I hope that people are understanding that it''s a clear sphere REFRACTING and not an opaque metallic sphere REFLECTING! this important distinction seems to have escaped the attention of some of those voting on my image... good luck', '2005-11-02 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833269, 250936, 17507, '<td valign="top">I dig the red in this image, except for on her face... she looks diseased or burned</td>', 'I dig the red in this image, except for on her face... she looks diseased or burned', '2005-11-02 13:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833272, 251020, 17507, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, but I wish the whites were brighter and that the swan weren''t so close to the top of the frame.</td>', 'I like this picture, but I wish the whites were brighter and that the swan weren''t so close to the top of the frame.', '2005-11-02 13:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833275, 250435, 17507, '<td valign="top">clever illusion of transparency.</td>', 'clever illusion of transparency.', '2005-11-02 13:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833278, 250150, 17507, '<td valign="top">very strong image. good colors. nice DOF.</td>', 'very strong image. good colors. nice DOF.', '2005-11-02 13:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833284, 251200, 17507, '<td valign="top">Pedro?<br/>I hope you survived this photo shoot to see your score!</td>', 'Pedro?I hope you survived this photo shoot to see your score!', '2005-11-02 13:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833295, 251403, 17033, '<td valign="top">V. clever processing but not sure the bride would find it flattering!</td>', 'V. clever processing but not sure the bride would find it flattering!', '2005-11-02 13:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833302, 250774, 17033, '<td valign="top">Another entry into the DPC ''strange doll photos'' gallery. Well done for keeping up a tradition!</td>', 'Another entry into the DPC ''strange doll photos'' gallery. Well done for keeping up a tradition!', '2005-11-02 13:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833307, 250878, 17033, '<td valign="top">Good find...nice work except perhaps could do with a tad more sharpness</td>', 'Good find...nice work except perhaps could do with a tad more sharpness', '2005-11-02 13:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833336, 251485, 17033, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but shame we can''t see more of the eye...the focal point of the image</td>', 'Interesting idea but shame we can''t see more of the eye...the focal point of the image', '2005-11-02 13:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833338, 251374, 17033, '<td valign="top">This is not a pipe (how DID you do it then?)</td>', 'This is not a pipe (how DID you do it then?)', '2005-11-02 13:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833345, 251454, 17033, '<td valign="top">Great idea but not sure about cropping on left</td>', 'Great idea but not sure about cropping on left', '2005-11-02 13:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833362, 250949, 17033, '<td valign="top">Excellent work...nice tones and good contrast between hand and shadowy figure behind</td>', 'Excellent work...nice tones and good contrast between hand and shadowy figure behind', '2005-11-02 13:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833365, 249128, 17033, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image</td>', 'Beautiful image', '2005-11-02 13:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833394, 251282, 17033, '<td valign="top">Superb. Great scene to start with and then very subtle yet affecting additions. Thought-provoking title, too.</td>', 'Superb. Great scene to start with and then very subtle yet affecting additions. Thought-provoking title, too.', '2005-11-02 14:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833395, 251423, 47131, '<td valign="top">Great pic.</td>', 'Great pic.', '2005-11-02 14:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833400, 251310, 17033, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t he have waited until the church had emptied, at the very least?</td>', 'Couldn''t he have waited until the church had emptied, at the very least?', '2005-11-02 14:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833411, 251388, 17033, '<td valign="top">Gas-masks are THE fashion accessory at DPC this season</td>', 'Gas-masks are THE fashion accessory at DPC this season', '2005-11-02 14:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833423, 251021, 17033, '<td valign="top">Attractive mix of clarity and confusion...good colours, too</td>', 'Attractive mix of clarity and confusion...good colours, too', '2005-11-02 14:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833425, 251303, 24212, '<td valign="top">Hairdo looks like mine.</td>', 'Hairdo looks like mine.', '2005-11-02 14:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833428, 251501, 17033, '<td valign="top">Very subtle...good work...focus on bubble wrap might have worked better than on the doll</td>', 'Very subtle...good work...focus on bubble wrap might have worked better than on the doll', '2005-11-02 14:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833432, 251374, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very clever.</td>', 'Very clever.', '2005-11-02 14:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833435, 251359, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and the crop, but feel that it could do with a touch more sharpening.</td>', 'I like the colours and the crop, but feel that it could do with a touch more sharpening.', '2005-11-02 14:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833438, 251003, 17033, '<td valign="top">Striking shot...triptych, light vs. shade, order vs. chaos......full house!</td>', 'Striking shot...triptych, light vs. shade, order vs. chaos......full house!', '2005-11-02 14:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833439, 249650, 17033, '<td valign="top">Beatiful and love the long shadows</td>', 'Beatiful and love the long shadows', '2005-11-02 14:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833442, 251180, 24212, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that I like the window frame within the shot. The dampness on the glass seems to give the foliage behind the watercolour look that you mention, so I wonder if just a shot through a pane would give as good an effect.</td>', 'I''m not sure that I like the window frame within the shot. The dampness on the glass seems to give the foliage behind the watercolour look that you mention, so I wonder if just a shot through a pane would give as good an effect.', '2005-11-02 14:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833445, 251531, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of peace from the still water. The reflection is wonderfully sharp, too.</td>', 'I like the sense of peace from the still water. The reflection is wonderfully sharp, too.', '2005-11-02 14:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833446, 251405, 17033, '<td valign="top">Another example of well executed subtlety in this challenge</td>', 'Another example of well executed subtlety in this challenge', '2005-11-02 14:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833453, 250203, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me this looks to soft and could do with some more sharpening.</td>', 'To me this looks to soft and could do with some more sharpening.', '2005-11-02 14:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833456, 251200, 17033, '<td valign="top">You''ll stay fresh until Christmas. Good work and attractive tones.</td>', 'You''ll stay fresh until Christmas. Good work and attractive tones.', '2005-11-02 14:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833459, 251402, 24212, '<td valign="top">A wonderful expression captured here.The shadow on the side of the face works really well. I wonder, though, whether some could be cropped off the left of the frame.</td>', 'A wonderful expression captured here.The shadow on the side of the face works really well. I wonder, though, whether some could be cropped off the left of the frame.', '2005-11-02 14:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833466, 251279, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that this could do with a bit more sharpening to bring out the texture of the glass.</td>', 'I feel that this could do with a bit more sharpening to bring out the texture of the glass.', '2005-11-02 14:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833470, 251282, 24212, '<td valign="top">A nicely atmospheric shot, even without the ethereal figures (which are also well done, by the way). Great contrast and sharpness.</td>', 'A nicely atmospheric shot, even without the ethereal figures (which are also well done, by the way). Great contrast and sharpness.', '2005-11-02 14:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833474, 251488, 24212, '<td valign="top">I personally feel that this could benefit from a little extra sharpening.</td>', 'I personally feel that this could benefit from a little extra sharpening.', '2005-11-02 14:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833485, 251568, 46172, '<td valign="top">i dont really like this picture...there isnt much of a focus</td>', 'i dont really like this picture...there isnt much of a focus', '2005-11-02 14:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833486, 248955, 24212, '<td valign="top">There seems to be some ''blockiness'' in this image. Was it over-compressed? Cropped severely?</td>', 'There seems to be some ''blockiness'' in this image. Was it over-compressed? Cropped severely?', '2005-11-02 14:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833491, 250774, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the hand at the bottom of the frame overpowers the rest of the picture.</td>', 'I think that the hand at the bottom of the frame overpowers the rest of the picture.', '2005-11-02 14:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833505, 249507, 24212, '<td valign="top">This is quite a striking image, although I feel that it could do with a bit more contrast. Also, there seems to be quite a lot of haloing around the underside of the telescope.</td>', 'This is quite a striking image, although I feel that it could do with a bit more contrast. Also, there seems to be quite a lot of haloing around the underside of the telescope.', '2005-11-02 14:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833511, 250452, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and particularly like the red sky, although the magnifying glass and hand, being so out of focus, don''t sit too well with the rest of the image.</td>', 'I like the composition and particularly like the red sky, although the magnifying glass and hand, being so out of focus, don''t sit too well with the rest of the image.', '2005-11-02 14:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833514, 250267, 45926, '<td valign="top">wow, i was so intrigued by what the little gold thing said, that i opened it up in photoshop then flipped it so that i could easily read it. very cool picture! the lighting is awesome! excellent job.</td>', 'wow, i was so intrigued by what the little gold thing said, that i opened it up in photoshop then flipped it so that i could easily read it. very cool picture! the lighting is awesome! excellent job.', '2005-11-02 14:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833515, 251010, 24212, '<td valign="top">The high-key look really works well here. Great shot.</td>', 'The high-key look really works well here. Great shot.', '2005-11-02 14:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833517, 250539, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, the lighting on the pumpkins looks a little harsh.</td>', 'To me, the lighting on the pumpkins looks a little harsh.', '2005-11-02 14:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833541, 251423, 24212, '<td valign="top">There are a number of ''transparent people'' shots in this challenge and this is by far and away my favourite. The amount of the exposure time devoted to the model seems to be absolutely spot-on. The right shoulder, for instance, completely covers the background, whereas the side of the body fades away smoothly. The texture of the background is conveyed well, too.</td>', 'There are a number of ''transparent people'' shots in this challenge and this is by far and away my favourite. The amount of the exposure time devoted to the model seems to be absolutely spot-on. The right shoulder, for instance, completely covers the background, whereas the side of the body fades away smoothly. The texture of the background is conveyed well, too.', '2005-11-02 14:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833553, 251568, 24212, '<td valign="top">I quite like this shot, but the moire pattern in the forehead region detracts somewhat. This could be corrected by a little blurring.</td>', 'I quite like this shot, but the moire pattern in the forehead region detracts somewhat. This could be corrected by a little blurring.', '2005-11-02 14:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
