(1835454, 250879, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simply amazing. Kubrick would be proud you chose to illustrate his movie title like this.  Great grunge and post editing.  The desat of the colors really works to help neutralize the human element and just leave light and dark. 10</td>', 'Simply amazing. Kubrick would be proud you chose to illustrate his movie title like this.  Great grunge and post editing.  The desat of the colors really works to help neutralize the human element and just leave light and dark. 10', '2005-11-03 08:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
