(1838047, 250879, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like the effect with the eyes.  I''ve done it a few times but never actually in a location shot where it would be worthwhile.  great idea for the challenge.  i hope the voters even notice it...</td>', 'I like the effect with the eyes.  I''ve done it a few times but never actually in a location shot where it would be worthwhile.  great idea for the challenge.  i hope the voters even notice it...', '2005-11-04 13:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
