(1838484, 251303, 42005, '<td valign="top">ijust love this.  I have to admit that it took me a couple views to really get it!   Nice work.</td>', 'ijust love this.  I have to admit that it took me a couple views to really get it!   Nice work.', '2005-11-04 16:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838491, 251405, 42005, '<td valign="top">Quite provocative and sultry.  Well done. 10</td>', 'Quite provocative and sultry.  Well done. 10', '2005-11-04 16:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838494, 250203, 44754, '<td valign="top">Too dark. maybe some light from the bottom would have been cool.</td>', 'Too dark. maybe some light from the bottom would have been cool.', '2005-11-04 16:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838545, 250983, 44754, '<td valign="top">Way cool. Is it legal? I''ve done this same thing before and seen lots of others but this is one of the better ones. Everything seems to line up just right.</td>', 'Way cool. Is it legal? I''ve done this same thing before and seen lots of others but this is one of the better ones. Everything seems to line up just right.', '2005-11-04 16:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838678, 250956, 43400, '<td valign="top">Wow beautiful--I''m curious to know where this was taken. Are the colors natural or manipulated? Gorgeous!</td>', 'Wow beautiful--I''m curious to know where this was taken. Are the colors natural or manipulated? Gorgeous!', '2005-11-04 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838692, 251168, 43400, '<td valign="top">looks delicious--good coloring--peaches?</td>', 'looks delicious--good coloring--peaches?', '2005-11-04 18:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838696, 251344, 43400, '<td valign="top">literally speaking--good choice--nice title too. Somehow, I''d like to see these on a "light table" having light shown through them.</td>', 'literally speaking--good choice--nice title too. Somehow, I''d like to see these on a "light table" having light shown through them.', '2005-11-04 18:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838699, 251568, 43400, '<td valign="top">interesting documentative gesture--good lighting and composition</td>', 'interesting documentative gesture--good lighting and composition', '2005-11-04 18:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838716, 251531, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cool reflection. I might have pushed the colors and contrast a bit more and flippin it wouldn''t hurt it either imo. Looks like Yosemite to me but it has been nine years since I last was there.</td>', 'Cool reflection. I might have pushed the colors and contrast a bit more and flippin it wouldn''t hurt it either imo. Looks like Yosemite to me but it has been nine years since I last was there.', '2005-11-04 18:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838717, 250949, 3032, '<td valign="top">Modern realism painting like. Interesting texture color and mood. 7</td>', 'Modern realism painting like. Interesting texture color and mood. 7', '2005-11-04 18:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838722, 249426, 43400, '<td valign="top">Took a minute to figure it out--good water-drop capture and transparency.</td>', 'Took a minute to figure it out--good water-drop capture and transparency.', '2005-11-04 18:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838724, 250662, 43400, '<td valign="top">The windows seem more reflective than transparent, but good capture</td>', 'The windows seem more reflective than transparent, but good capture', '2005-11-04 18:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838730, 250451, 43400, '<td valign="top">Creative graphic capture--certainly meets the challenge--I like it</td>', 'Creative graphic capture--certainly meets the challenge--I like it', '2005-11-04 18:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838734, 250366, 43400, '<td valign="top">Good capture, but I think it''s screaming to be B&amp;W and a contrast boost in my opinion. Great sky and sun highlights.</td>', 'Good capture, but I think it''s screaming to be B&W and a contrast boost in my opinion. Great sky and sun highlights.', '2005-11-04 18:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838791, 249307, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.<br/>Could use a bit of contrast (like +20 in photoshop).<br/>I wonder what a longer shutter speed would do with the photo.</td>', 'Nice idea.Could use a bit of contrast (like +20 in photoshop).I wonder what a longer shutter speed would do with the photo.', '2005-11-04 18:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838797, 251282, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cool. Nice spooky mood. Interesting toning.<br/>Might have more impact with harder contrast. Like +40 in Photoshop. +40 will also make the colors stand out a whole lot better.<br/></td>', 'Cool. Nice spooky mood. Interesting toning.Might have more impact with harder contrast. Like +40 in Photoshop. +40 will also make the colors stand out a whole lot better.', '2005-11-04 18:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838801, 249993, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good work with the bg, nice mystic arabian mood (glass models) with a clear hard western twist (light, contrast and color).</td>', 'Good work with the bg, nice mystic arabian mood (glass models) with a clear hard western twist (light, contrast and color).', '2005-11-04 18:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838803, 251485, 3032, '<td valign="top">Dreamlike/Nightmarish weird view. Interestingm I like it. 7</td>', 'Dreamlike/Nightmarish weird view. Interestingm I like it. 7', '2005-11-04 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838809, 250577, 3032, '<td valign="top">A bit bright/ overexposed. Try to pull down the curve in  curves in Photoshop to get better contrast. Concept is good, you get the idea of natural diamond cutting.</td>', 'A bit bright/ overexposed. Try to pull down the curve in  curves in Photoshop to get better contrast. Concept is good, you get the idea of natural diamond cutting.', '2005-11-04 18:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838812, 251020, 3032, '<td valign="top">The light swan vs the weird grein textures is interesting. Just wish the swan was a bit brighter.</td>', 'The light swan vs the weird grein textures is interesting. Just wish the swan was a bit brighter.', '2005-11-04 19:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838815, 248989, 3032, '<td valign="top">You''ve seen the original movies? :)<br/>299km/h on the Periferie of Paris....<br/> <br/></td>', 'You''ve seen the original movies? :)299km/h on the Periferie of Paris.... ', '2005-11-04 19:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838818, 248870, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the soft mood and softness of the colors</td>', 'I like the soft mood and softness of the colors', '2005-11-04 19:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838820, 249349, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great contrast. It just looses connection with reality, but perhaps that is what makes it look so good. :)</td>', 'Great contrast. It just looses connection with reality, but perhaps that is what makes it look so good. :)', '2005-11-04 19:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838822, 251074, 3032, '<td valign="top">Very feminine. The lack of symmetry is what hurts the photo.</td>', 'Very feminine. The lack of symmetry is what hurts the photo.', '2005-11-04 19:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838830, 249507, 3032, '<td valign="top">I would like it more with harder contrast +30 in PS.<br/>I know that that would blow out some highlights but under the  advanced editing rules you are allowe to correct for that with the history brush.</td>', 'I would like it more with harder contrast +30 in PS.I know that that would blow out some highlights but under the  advanced editing rules you are allowe to correct for that with the history brush.', '2005-11-04 19:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838832, 249128, 3032, '<td valign="top">It is almost like the leaf contains a hidden story in some strange language.<br/></td>', 'It is almost like the leaf contains a hidden story in some strange language.', '2005-11-04 19:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838848, 251280, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting play with B&amp;W vs color, composition and poses.<br/>I think that the lighting is lacking a bit (not meant as harsh as it sounds); I''d like to see the shadows on his chest, her back and on the rose leafes softened a bit, with brighter skin tones without losing contrast. Hard eh? 7 Anyway. :)</td>', 'Interesting play with B&W vs color, composition and poses.I think that the lighting is lacking a bit (not meant as harsh as it sounds); I''d like to see the shadows on his chest, her back and on the rose leafes softened a bit, with brighter skin tones without losing contrast. Hard eh? 7 Anyway. :)', '2005-11-04 19:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838866, 250940, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice soft color mood.</td>', 'Nice soft color mood.', '2005-11-04 19:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838874, 250879, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, I like the idea a lot.<br/>But it looks very overprocessed. Would do great as a painting but less as photograph.</td>', 'Interesting concept, I like the idea a lot.But it looks very overprocessed. Would do great as a painting but less as photograph.', '2005-11-04 19:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838918, 250451, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice, but it would have more impact with proper curves. White looks like murkey grey. Just hit the white eyedropper on the white and it would look a whole lot better.</td>', 'Nice, but it would have more impact with proper curves. White looks like murkey grey. Just hit the white eyedropper on the white and it would look a whole lot better.', '2005-11-04 19:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838939, 249842, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting.<br/>Great B&amp;W / mixed with some purplegrey underneath.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'Interesting.Great B&W / mixed with some purplegrey underneath. 8', '2005-11-04 19:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838954, 249981, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wow, weird! :)<br/>So close and you used some interesting psychedelic backgrounds that refract well. 7<br/></td>', 'Wow, weird! :)So close and you used some interesting psychedelic backgrounds that refract well. 7', '2005-11-04 19:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838960, 251288, 3032, '<td valign="top">It would come more alive with brightness +20, contrast +25 and some saturation tweaking.</td>', 'It would come more alive with brightness +20, contrast +25 and some saturation tweaking.', '2005-11-04 19:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838964, 251200, 3032, '<td valign="top">Weird, almost underwaterlike. The highlights are a bit distracting in that respect.</td>', 'Weird, almost underwaterlike. The highlights are a bit distracting in that respect.', '2005-11-04 19:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838972, 251383, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot. Tansparency is not the strongest asset here tough.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Nice clean shot. Tansparency is not the strongest asset here tough. ', '2005-11-04 19:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838980, 250376, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The tones are a bit dark and blah.</td>', 'Nice idea. The tones are a bit dark and blah.', '2005-11-04 19:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
