(1839533, 251583, 43115, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what I''m looking at behind the screen.  I imagine there''s water in each of the little holes, refracting the flower (?) behind it?<br/> <br/>Honestly, it''s been done before, it''s been done better, and it''s not really transparency.<br/> <br/>Good effort though.</td>', 'I don''t know what I''m looking at behind the screen.  I imagine there''s water in each of the little holes, refracting the flower (?) behind it? Honestly, it''s been done before, it''s been done better, and it''s not really transparency. Good effort though.', '2005-11-05 00:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1839535, 251147, 43115, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty picture, but I don''t think that shutter speed type ghosts are really transparency.  Too bad you couldn''t have known that the shutter speed challenge was coming, this would be a very strong entry there, but it doesn''t meet <i>my</i> definition of this challenge.<br/> <br/>Good use of selective de-sat.  I love the blue eyes.</td>', 'It''s a pretty picture, but I don''t think that shutter speed type ghosts are really transparency.  Too bad you couldn''t have known that the shutter speed challenge was coming, this would be a very strong entry there, but it doesn''t meet my definition of this challenge. Good use of selective de-sat.  I love the blue eyes.', '2005-11-05 00:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1839540, 249621, 43115, '<td valign="top">The water has a milky look to it due to slow shutter speed.  In a closeup like this I think it would be better with a fast shutter speed to stop the motion and show off the clear water.  Also the flash highlights are pretty distracting.  Could you have cropped them out?</td>', 'The water has a milky look to it due to slow shutter speed.  In a closeup like this I think it would be better with a fast shutter speed to stop the motion and show off the clear water.  Also the flash highlights are pretty distracting.  Could you have cropped them out?', '2005-11-05 00:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1839542, 250539, 43115, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty picture, but I don''t think that shutter speed (or multiple exposures of a long shutter speed) type ghosts are really transparency.  Too bad you couldn''t have known that the shutter speed challenge was coming, this would be a very strong entry there, but it doesn''t meet <i>my</i> definition of this challenge.</td>', 'It''s a pretty picture, but I don''t think that shutter speed (or multiple exposures of a long shutter speed) type ghosts are really transparency.  Too bad you couldn''t have known that the shutter speed challenge was coming, this would be a very strong entry there, but it doesn''t meet my definition of this challenge.', '2005-11-05 00:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
