(1839553, 251310, 41675, '<td valign="top">While this is a nice shot, good colors and composition. I think I would like it even better if the buttocks were completely cropped out. For me, it would leave a bit more mystery for the imagination.</td>', 'While this is a nice shot, good colors and composition. I think I would like it even better if the buttocks were completely cropped out. For me, it would leave a bit more mystery for the imagination.', '2005-11-05 00:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
