(1841183, 250936, 41522, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot.  I love the red on red on red ...  Nicely composed.  Good lighting.  Good exposure/processing.  If I could change one thing it would be the crease in the material that hides her right eye.  I feel that crease is a bit distracting.  JMO.  Overall, a very good portait photo!</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot.  I love the red on red on red ...  Nicely composed.  Good lighting.  Good exposure/processing.  If I could change one thing it would be the crease in the material that hides her right eye.  I feel that crease is a bit distracting.  JMO.  Overall, a very good portait photo!', '2005-11-05 21:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
