(1843362, 251054, 43115, '<td valign="top">Technically it''s a very good photo, the lighting is good, the background is good, everything is well done in this shot.  However, it''s just not very exciting... DPC rewards people who go out of their way to really tell a story.</td>', 'Technically it''s a very good photo, the lighting is good, the background is good, everything is well done in this shot.  However, it''s just not very exciting... DPC rewards people who go out of their way to really tell a story.', '2005-11-06 23:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843367, 250994, 43115, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty shot, but the water drops are getting very tired.  Also the transparency is not the <i>point</i> of the photo, it''s just a pretty macro shot that happens to have water drops in it.</td>', 'It''s a pretty shot, but the water drops are getting very tired.  Also the transparency is not the point of the photo, it''s just a pretty macro shot that happens to have water drops in it.', '2005-11-06 23:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843369, 250940, 39057, '<td valign="top">Look at the face !</td>', 'Look at the face !', '2005-11-06 23:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843371, 249523, 43115, '<td valign="top">It''s a tired idea, and quite honestly it''s been done better before.  The bubbles in the top right are distracting.  Also, the thought of a kid trapped under water is really unsettling.</td>', 'It''s a tired idea, and quite honestly it''s been done better before.  The bubbles in the top right are distracting.  Also, the thought of a kid trapped under water is really unsettling.', '2005-11-06 23:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843378, 251303, 43115, '<td valign="top">To me multiple (light) exposures or shutter speed tricks don''t really meet the point of this challenge.  It''s an interesting picture, but at the same time vaguely unsettling.  Interesting, but also, the proportions seem off.  (The real head is much smaller than the mask.)</td>', 'To me multiple (light) exposures or shutter speed tricks don''t really meet the point of this challenge.  It''s an interesting picture, but at the same time vaguely unsettling.  Interesting, but also, the proportions seem off.  (The real head is much smaller than the mask.)', '2005-11-06 23:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
