(1843849, 250663, 45965, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by DrAchoo:</b></div><hr/><i> The elements of this picture just don''t really go together.  On one hand it looks like you took the time to set up a nice still life.  On the other you got the boozer asleep on the couch.  Technically a little more light on the pretzels and a little more DOF to get the bauble more in focus (I''m not even sure what it is). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I should not have added the candle, it didn''t work. As to the "boozer", I don''t think you quite got the message of "Monday Night Football" I was going for, no fault of yours, but he is integral to the "story" of the picture. Not my best effort but I had some fun doing it which was all I was looking for really. Better luck next time I hope. :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by DrAchoo: The elements of this picture just don''t really go together.  On one hand it looks like you took the time to set up a nice still life.  On the other you got the boozer asleep on the couch.  Technically a little more light on the pretzels and a little more DOF to get the bauble more in focus (I''m not even sure what it is).   I should not have added the candle, it didn''t work. As to the "boozer", I don''t think you quite got the message of "Monday Night Football" I was going for, no fault of yours, but he is integral to the "story" of the picture. Not my best effort but I had some fun doing it which was all I was looking for really. Better luck next time I hope. :-)', '2005-11-07 01:07:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1843851, 251364, 28882, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why you didn''t place higher. one of those 10''s was mine.  I still love this shot.</td>', 'I don''t understand why you didn''t place higher. one of those 10''s was mine.  I still love this shot.', '2005-11-07 01:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
