(1844045, 250956, 35720, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot everyone for your votes and comments - it''s much appreciated.  Some of you asked if these colours were real and I can assure you that they are - these are the natural colours of the Northern lights although they can be a bit different from time to time. The sky was amazing that evening and I happened to be well positioned with my camera and tripod.</td>', 'Thanks a lot everyone for your votes and comments - it''s much appreciated.  Some of you asked if these colours were real and I can assure you that they are - these are the natural colours of the Northern lights although they can be a bit different from time to time. The sky was amazing that evening and I happened to be well positioned with my camera and tripod.', '2005-11-07 03:34:39.000000', NULL, 0),
