(1844955, 251403, 6388, '<td valign="top">well done, bro.  nice work on the top ten.  I agree with kiwi about the top-cropping, but that''s a pretty minor nit-pick.  Would have been way hotter if she were wearing the Teef, but it''s a little late for that now.<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'well done, bro.  nice work on the top ten.  I agree with kiwi about the top-cropping, but that''s a pretty minor nit-pick.  Would have been way hotter if she were wearing the Teef, but it''s a little late for that now. P', '2005-11-07 14:59:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1844956, 250983, 15497, '<td valign="top">The Kiwi man is back!<br/>Samara is scary... Fantastic setup, great light and very creative! Nice to see you back here Gary! Congratulations with the ribbon!<br/></td>', 'The Kiwi man is back!Samara is scary... Fantastic setup, great light and very creative! Nice to see you back here Gary! Congratulations with the ribbon!', '2005-11-07 14:59:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1845001, 251485, 34659, '<td valign="top">I scored this an 8.  It has a certain air about it that screams artistic angst (and I love that kinda stuff!).  Surprised this didn''t finish higher actually, but congrats on your second highest score.  I look forward to seeing more and more of your very promising work!  :-)</td>', 'I scored this an 8.  It has a certain air about it that screams artistic angst (and I love that kinda stuff!).  Surprised this didn''t finish higher actually, but congrats on your second highest score.  I look forward to seeing more and more of your very promising work!  :-)', '2005-11-07 15:21:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1845026, 250729, 19708, '<td valign="top">A Dax - what an honor!<br/>Always fun to try new things here. Thanks for all the comments.</td>', 'A Dax - what an honor!Always fun to try new things here. Thanks for all the comments.', '2005-11-07 15:30:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1845111, 251374, 39270, '<td valign="top">Should have placed higher!  I am always amazed at your display of creativity and skill.</td>', 'Should have placed higher!  I am always amazed at your display of creativity and skill.', '2005-11-07 15:54:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1845124, 249993, 20075, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the helpful comments, everyone.  When I looked at the other entries in this challenge, I immediately thought to myself, oh, no - mine''s so dull!  And that''s pretty much the response I got from all of you: technically sound, for the most part, but uninspired.<br/> <br/>Considering that this was the first time I tried using a white background and really focused on lighting, though, I''m happy with the results.  Now that I have a better idea of lighting for white-background subjects, I can try to be more creative when I decide to shoot them.</td>', 'Thanks for all the helpful comments, everyone.  When I looked at the other entries in this challenge, I immediately thought to myself, oh, no - mine''s so dull!  And that''s pretty much the response I got from all of you: technically sound, for the most part, but uninspired. Considering that this was the first time I tried using a white background and really focused on lighting, though, I''m happy with the results.  Now that I have a better idea of lighting for white-background subjects, I can try to be more creative when I decide to shoot them.', '2005-11-07 15:59:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1845191, 250983, 45930, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like this picture~ Awesome Samara.</td>', 'Wow, I really like this picture~ Awesome Samara.', '2005-11-07 16:23:34.000000', NULL, 0),
