(1851477, 251458, 17507, '<td valign="top">ah, so it WAS in fact a transparency... you pulled off the watery effect so well that I assumed it was being reflected in water! The illusion (created with transparency) was convincing enough that it didn''t even look transparent. Funny how that works, I encountered the same problem with my submission.</td>', 'ah, so it WAS in fact a transparency... you pulled off the watery effect so well that I assumed it was being reflected in water! The illusion (created with transparency) was convincing enough that it didn''t even look transparent. Funny how that works, I encountered the same problem with my submission.', '2005-11-09 14:55:01.000000', NULL, 0),
